<title>USA: Building Materials sets $100 mln in 144A notes.</title>
<headline>Building Materials sets $100 mln in 144A notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Building Materials Corp was priced on Wednesday in the 144A private placement market, according to lead manager Bear Stearns &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER BUILDING MATERIALS CORP</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	  COUPON 8.625 PCT  MATURITY 12/15/2006</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES	ISS PRICE 99.502  FIRST PAY DATE 06/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S (P)BA3 YIELD  8.70 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB	   SPREAD 260 BP     CALLABLE AFTER FIVE</p>
<p>						    YEARS</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
